                        <img alt="COO" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500" data-alt="A professional headshot of an experienced operations director, South Asian male, dressed in a sharp business casual shirt. He is standing against a wall with subtle architectural blueprints. The mood is industrious and capable, with crisp lighting and a polished corporate aesthetic." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDCZOq3aUigBTAUtgTP0gwHLvsJu8qqwRkiQ5tBIILvpPRfK9-q1DZCfYE2ZgGt9R8buBgI7EySRHHdXChHbg2hjnuA2KRey0dazsMQ3ZJn9O4cnDQYCs7Wg5noKhIbaL-5I5kx04Ej0R8r8BVxWfchM2svsuOOnbXE0rPc63OXFqWuv4wl3LznGTAGCNS2PsPVLu9P76SKLitGiVdTz2ecxD7czwS8robKSScT_z__IPGHGpyIazmDTsIK56KKK61MRiIgUH3_3wx6"/>
